<title>POLAND: BRE revises down 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>BRE revises down 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRE audited results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     197.16  vs 173.07</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 197.16  vs 173.07</p>
<p>    net profit			     114.72  vs 105.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA. The bank earlier showed a net profit of 134.9 million.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     1.20  vs   0.46</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    496.50  vs 371.47</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 273.60  vs 172.29</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    64.40  vs  43.01</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    4.45  vs   2.61</p>
<p>    income tax				82.45  vs  67.71</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na   vs    na</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
